(Leave and Attendance Policy) Tj T*
(SAMPLE POLICY - fictional content for the OnboardIQ demo. Not real company policy.) Tj T*
(1. Annual leave) Tj T*
(Full-time employees receive eighteen \(18\) days of paid annual leave per calendar year.) Tj T*
(Annual leave accrues monthly at 1.5 days per month of service.) Tj T*
(Leave requests must be submitted in the HR portal at least three working days in advance.) Tj T*
(Managers respond to leave requests within two working days.) Tj T*
ET
