(4. Carry forward and encashment) Tj T*
(Up to ten unused annual leave days may be carried forward into the next calendar year.) Tj T*
(Carried forward days must be used by March 31, after which they expire.) Tj T*
(Leave cannot be encashed except at the end of employment, as required by local law.) Tj T*
(5. Attendance) Tj T*
(Core collaboration hours are 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM on working days.) Tj T*
